.TH NAZCA 1 "2026" "Livyatan Design Suite" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
nazca \- toolpath and slice-file viewer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B nazca
[\fIFILE\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Walk the lines before the machine does. Loads G-code (.nc, .gcode, .ngc,
\&.tap) and draws every move in 3D, colored by class for the machine the file is for; loads unencrypted ChiTu
\&.ctb and shows layers, heights, exposure, and the preview. It reads and
never writes. An encrypted v5 .ctb is refused with a clear message rather
than decoded wrong. G-code coverage is G0\(enG3 with arcs; files leaning
on G92 offsets or G91 incremental mode will not preview true.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR hephaestus (1),
.BR jove (1),
.BR livyatan (7).
